{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/extras/b0d7fcb3080cfcaadbbfc71d74d677ad.avif?t=1766153714\" width=1344 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a cybersecurity educator, Hacker Society\u2019s network worlds will test you as you sneak, fight, and hack your way to spilling the secrets of the biggest corporate megacompanies. You\u2019re payl0de, an experienced Offensive Security professional trying to unravel the mystery of his missing partner. Standing against you and your hacker collective are 10 levels of deadly enemies, traps and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/extras/801f2a536b6061c984f926bb9bc01c20.poster.avif?t=1766153714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/extras/801f2a536b6061c984f926bb9bc01c20.webm?t=1766153714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to build a path forward with minigames that are based on real linux, cryptography and hacking techniques. Players can even choose to complete basic capture-the-flag challenges for extra rewards, and acquire the ability to hack the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/extras/7d9b4409da6b70e3e0f8de959c3b098e.poster.avif?t=1766153714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/extras/7d9b4409da6b70e3e0f8de959c3b098e.webm?t=1766153714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your assignments as you discover the mysterious r00t sword, purchase upgrades and abilities, and take on strange and colorful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/extras/929e255ace42fc4c91dcddb2961a0542.avif?t=1766153714\" width=1349 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/extras/b9221cfebf6433b16d73e39148502de1.poster.avif?t=1766153714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/extras/b9221cfebf6433b16d73e39148502de1.webm?t=1766153714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of games with fake hacking minigames, Hacker Society\u2019s combination of fighting and cybersecurity puzzles was built to blend fast-paced platforming with cybersecurity elements that are authentic and story-driven. Do you have what it takes to find your friend and expose the megacompanies? Wishlist now.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075570?t=1766153714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/3d996d57136fc1ded2665d7bfe5f5a52dc228b3e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766153714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/8f04fac3a679cf74b1004ba445bc902f5d62ce4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766153714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075570/8f04fac3a679cf74b1004ba445bc902f5d62ce4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766153714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78}